# The game for hosting: haxe hxml/build.dist.hxml -> the release build in out/dist/ with its page and assets/, zipped as
# out/{name}-web.zip with index.html at its root, what itch.io takes. hxml/serve.dist.hxml serves it to try first.
hxml/common.hxml
-D helix-backend=webgl2
-dce full
-D analyzer-optimize
-js out/dist/app.js
--macro helix.tool.Build.cleanOutput()
--macro helix.tool.Build.generateWebPage()
--macro helix.tool.Build.copyAssets()
--macro helix.tool.Build.zipOutput("out/{name}-web.zip")
